  "body": "Absolutely! If you are looking for a standalone home with high-end-finishes, a peaceful living environment, and the convenience of being with walking distance of schools, the beach, the shops, and other local amenities, this could be the perfect home for you!\r\n\r\nStrongly advise an inspection if you are looking for:\r\n- Freehold title, CCC and New title are both ready, move-in before Christmas\r\n- NO society fee or Body Corporate \r\n- 4 bedrooms 2.5 bathrooms with single internal garage modern design layout\r\n- Downstairs: Open plan living and dining with guest toilet and good size of laundry room\r\n- Upstairs: Master bedroom with ensuite plus three good size bedrooms with separate bathroom\r\n- Low maintenance garden, lock-up and leave\r\n- Zoned for Rangitoto College, Murrays Bay intermediate, Browns Bay School, Northcross Intermediate\r\nAnd much more features, welcome to bring your family to come and inspect yourself, we are happy to provide more information at site.\r\n\r\nPresent ALL offers. DEADLINE Closes: Wednesday, 11th NOV at 3pm (Unless Sold Prior)\r\n\r\nConjunction from ALL Agents welcome from day one.",
